\cf0 Cracker approached loading dock 20, located at the rear of Hardy Tower 1, but prior to entry he made one last glance around to ensure he had not been followed. He entered the dock and approached a non-descript lightly painted brick wall that, upon his approach, began to shimmer before revealing itself as an elevator door which automatically opened. As the door slid open Cracker was picked and hurled into the elevator by two darkly dressed and serious looking dudes. 
